node_cache_timeout` | `1h`    | Inode/node map eviction TTL |","locale":"en","table":"table-8"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-290","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                                    |\n| ----------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `direct_io` | `false` | Bypass the kernel page cache for all opens |","locale":"en","table":"table-8"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-291","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"| Field                  | Default | Meaning                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `open_direct_on_stale` | `false` | Per-open direct I/O when local metadata is stale |","locale":"en","table":"table-8"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-292","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                      |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `write_back_cache` | `false` | Let the kernel buffer writes |","locale":"en","table":"table-8"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-293","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                  |\n| --------------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\