ine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`meta_cache_capacity` and `node_cache_size` were removed. Use `meta_cache_timeout` and `node_cache_timeout` instead.","locale":"en"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-303","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`negative_timeout = 0` disables negative-lookup caching; it does not mean \"cache forever\".","locale":"en"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-304","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`direct_io` and `write_back_cache` cannot both be enabled; startup rejects the combination.","locale":"en"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-305","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`fuse_opts` supports the VFS pairs `ro`/`rw`, `nodev`/`dev`, `nosuid`/`suid`, `noexec`/`exec`, `noatime`/`atime`, `sync`/`async`, plus `dirsync`, `allow_other`, `default_permissions`, and `big_write`. The legacy libfuse options `auto_unmount`, `allow_root`, and `max_write` are not supported by the direct mount backend.","locale":"en"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-306","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"Duration values accept strings (`\"1s\"`, `\"500ms\"`, `\"1h\"`) or bare integers interpreted as milliseconds. The older `*_ms` keys remain aliases.","locale":"en"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-307","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"The top-level `[log]` section is shared by the Rust client and FUSE. Each service also has its own nested `log` table (`master.log`, `worker.log`, `mds.log`, `transfer.log`) and the CLI has `[cli].log`.","locale":"en"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-308","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field   | Default | Meaning   |\n| ------- | ------- | --------- |\n| `level` | `INFO`  | Log level |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-309","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field     | Default  | Meaning                                             |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log_dir` | `stdout` | `stdout`, `stderr`, or a directory for file logging |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-310","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| ----------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `file_name` | empty   | Base log file name; empty means `curvine` |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-311","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","u