luster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                 |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `display_position` | `true`  | Include source location |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-316","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]`    | Split named log targets into separate files |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-317","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"Rotation only applies when `log_dir` is a directory. With size and time rotation both unset, files rotate by size at 100 MB. If `max_file_size_mb = 0` and no valid `time_rotation` is configured, files rotate daily so they cannot grow without limit.","locale":"en"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-318","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#cli","content":"`CliConf` contains only `log`. The default CLI log level is `warn`, with output to stdout.","locale":"en"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-319","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"`[job]` configures the legacy Master-side job implementation used by clients with `transfer.enabled = false`. Transfer jobs use `[transfer]` for ownership, recovery, and retention.","locale":"en"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-320","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning             |\n| -------------- | ------- | ------------------- |\n| `job_life_ttl` | `24h`   | Job record lifetime |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-321","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field             | Default | Meaning                           |\n| ----------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `job_cleanup_ttl` | `10m`   | Cleanup interval for expired jobs |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-322","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning                               |\n| -------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `terminal_retention` | `10m`   | How long terminal jobs stay queryable |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-323","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field           | Default  | Meaning               |\n| --------------- | -------- | --------------------