stributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                             | Default | Meaning                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `master_load_job_runtime_threads` | `4`     | Runtime threads reserved for load planning |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-328","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                              | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `master_load_job_blocking_threads` | `16`    | Blocking threads reserved for load planning |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-329","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                                   | Default | Meaning                                                  |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `master_failed_load_job_retry_interval` | `30s`   | Reuse window for deterministic source-not-found failures |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-330","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning                     |\n| -------------- | ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `task_timeout` | `1h`    | Maximum task execution time |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-331","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                  | Default | Meaning                       |\n| ---------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `task_report_interval` | `10s`   | Task progress report interval |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-332","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                         | Default | Meaning                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `worker_max_concurrent_tasks` | `100`   | Maximum concurrent tasks per Worker |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-333","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"`[transfer]` is read by the standalone Transfer service and by clients that submit Load and Export work to it. A Transfer service also needs the normal `[client]` Master addresses. During a staged rollout, keep this section disabled in the Master and Worker configuration and enable it only in the Transfer and selected client configurations.","locale":"en"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                             