ross Master nodes","locale":"en"},"1977":{"id":"/docs/Overview/introduction-14","page_id":"/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Overview/introduction#core-features","content":"**Built-in observability**: Exposes monitoring and metrics for cluster components","locale":"en"},"1978":{"id":"/docs/Overview/introduction-15","page_id":"/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Overview/introduction#core-features","content":"**Web management interface**: Provides browser-based status and management pages on service web ports","locale":"en"},"1979":{"id":"/docs/Overview/introduction-16","page_id":"/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Overview/introduction#use-cases","content":"Curvine is designed for high-performance, high-concurrency, and massive data caching scenarios:","locale":"en"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/Overview/introduction-17","page_id":"/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Overview/introduction#use-cases","content":"**Deep Learning Training**: Provides high-speed data access for deep learning training, significantly reducing data loading time, improving GPU utilization, and accelerating model training processes","locale":"en"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/Overview/introduction-18","page_id":"/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Overview/introduction#use-cases","content":"**Large Language Model Inference**: Optimizes data access for LLM inference scenarios, reducing inference latency and improving model service response speed and throughput","locale":"en"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/Overview/introduction-19","page_id":"/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Overview/introduction#use-cases","content":"**Analytical Databases and OLAP Engines**: Provides high-speed caching for analytical databases and OLAP engines, significantly improving complex query performance and reducing data analysis time","locale":"en"},"1983":{"id":