itecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#构建供-fluid-使用的-curvine-镜像","content":"在 `CacheRuntimeClass` 和 `ThinRuntimeProfile` 里使用同一个镜像。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3473":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#构建供-fluid-使用的-curvine-镜像","content":"CacheRuntime `DataLoad` 路径已经用 Fluid chart `helm-chart-fluid-1.1.0-alpha.10` 验证过；该 chart 对应的 Fluid 镜像 tag 是 `v1.1.0-676f47a`。如果使用更旧的 chart 或自定义 DataLoad 模板，请看下面 DataLoad 章节里的 fallback 说明。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3474":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-快速开始","content":"当你希望 Fluid 创建并管理 Curvine 缓存 Pod 时，使用 CacheRuntime。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3475":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"从这个文件开始：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3476":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3477":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"这个 class 定义了 Fluid 如何启动 Curvine 的各个角色：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3478":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"| 角色       | Kubernetes 工作负载 | 作用                      