timeClass.dataOperationSpecs` 定义“这个缓存运行时如何执行 DataLoad”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3510":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`DataLoad` 资源定义“要给哪个 Dataset 预热哪些路径”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3511":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"在已有 `CacheRuntimeClass` 顶层增加 `dataOperationSpecs`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3512":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"只需要增加这个字段。不要为了打开 DataLoad 去改 `topology`、`fileSystemType` 或 master/worker/client 定义。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3513":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"不要把这段直接当成完整生产命令复制使用，除非你的 DataLoad 镜像或脚本会在执行 `cv load` 前生成 `/etc/curvine.toml`。Curvine 示例 `curvine-docker/fluid/cache-runtime/curvine-cache-runtime-class.yaml` 已经包含这部分逻辑。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3514":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Fluid 会把这些环境变量注入 DataLoad Job：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3515":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                      | 含义       |\n| ------------------------- | -------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_METADATA` | 是否加载元数据。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3516":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                       | 含义                   |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` | 要加载的路径，多个路径用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3517":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                           | 含义                    |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_PATH_REPLICAS` | 每个路径的副本数，多个值用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3518":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Curvine 的 CacheRuntimeClass 示例会在 `dataOperationSpecs` 里内联 DataLoad 脚本，因为 Fluid 会把数据操作作为短生命周期 Job 执行。脚本会先从 Fluid runtime JSON 生成 Curvine 配置；如果这个文件没有挂载，再依次回退到 Dataset 元数据、Pod label，以及 `<dataset>-load` 这类 DataLoad 名称规则。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3519":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"当 Fluid 传入 `/minio` 这样的 Dataset 内路径时，脚本会读取 Curvine mount 元数据，把它解析成真正需要加载的 Curvine source，再执行 `cv load --watch`。这样 DataLoad 和 `mountUFS` 的语义是一致的。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3520":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","