t","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"如果你的 DataLoad 命令需要读取 runtime JSON，请同时确认两件事：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3527":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"DataLoad Pod 中设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3528":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"DataLoad Pod 内这个文件真实存在。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3529":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"如果文件不存在，Curvine 示例会按下面顺序尝试 fallback：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3530":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"`CURVINE_DATALOAD_DATASET`、`FLUID_DATASET_NAME` 或 `CURVINE_DATALOAD_MASTER_HOST`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3531":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"Fluid Pod label，例如 `targetDataset` 或 `fluid.io/dataset-id`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3532":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-114","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"从 DataLoad 名称推断 Dataset，例如 `<dataset>-load`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3533":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/flu