transfer 段落。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4369":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"当 `net_interface` 非空（例如 `\"eth0\"`）时，Curvine 会解析该网卡的第一个 IPv4 地址，并将其应用到 `master`、`mds`、`journal`、`worker`、`client` 和 `transfer` 的 hostname。设置该字段后，`CURVINE_*_HOSTNAME` 环境变量会被忽略。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4370":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"`net_interface` 只填充**本节点自身**的 hostname。集群成员列表（`journal.journal_addrs` 与 `client.master_addrs`）仍必须显式填写，且每个节点的条目必须使用其网卡实际解析出的 IPv4。否则节点无法在 Raft 组中定位自己，启动时会给出明确错误。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4371":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"当前 `ClusterConf` 的主要段落如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4372":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"| 段落   | 作用                                                                     |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层字段 | `format_master`、`format_worker`、`testing`、`cluster_id`、`net_interface` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4373":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","ta