ocs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#1-构建网关","content":"二进制文件输出到 `target/release/curvine-s3-gateway`。发行包目前尚未包含该二进制，请从构建输出目录运行，或将其复制到网关所在机器。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5622":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#2-配置集群连接","content":"网关复用常规的 Curvine 集群配置文件。为网关相关设置添加 `[s3_gateway]` 部分；`[client]`、`[master]` 等其他部分用于连接集群：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5623":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#2-配置集群连接","content":"所有选项见 配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5624":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"网关没有内置的默认凭据。请生成密钥对并写入凭据存储：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5625":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"或注册已有的密钥对（access key 长度必须为 16–32 个字符，secret key 为 16–64 个字符）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5626":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"以上命令使用配置文件所选的凭据存储。详见 凭据管理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5627":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#4-启动网关","content":"默认监听地址为 `0.0.0.0:9900`。可以在命令行覆盖监听地址和 region：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5628":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#4-启动网关","content":"仅当 `--listen` 和 `--region` 的取值不同于内置默认值（`0.0.0.0:9900` 和 `us-east-1`）时，它们才会覆盖配置文件中的值。这两个值请使用配置文件设置，或在命令行显式传入不同的值。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5629":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数       | 描述             | 默认值                        |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `--conf` | Curvine 集群配置文件 | `etc/curvine-cluster.toml` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5630":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数         | 描述                | 默认值            |\n| ---------- | ----------------- | -------------- |\n| `--listen` | 监听地址（`host:port`） | `0.0.0.0:9900` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5631":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数         | 描述           | 默认值         |\n| ---------- | ------------ | ----------- |\n| `--region` | S3 region 标识 | `us-east-1` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5632":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数                   | 描述       | 默认值                |\n| -------------------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `--credentials-path` | 覆盖凭据存储路径 | `[s3_gateway]` 中的值 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5633":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数      | 描述                 | 默认值 |\n|