h-cn"},"5654":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令","content":"`credential list --show-secrets` 和 `credential generate` 会将 secret key 打印到终端。请将该输出视为敏感信息，避免写入 shell 历史或共享日志。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5655":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#使用示例","content":"以下示例使用 `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` 和 `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`。请先导出在 快速开始 中创建的密钥对：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5656":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#range-请求","content":"Range 响应使用状态码 `206`，并包含 `Content-Range` 头。签名请求最简单的生成方式是使用 S3 SDK 或 AWS CLI。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5657":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#分片上传-1","content":"`AbortMultipartUpload` 尚未路由，因此放弃的上传会在临时存储目录中留下分片，需要手动清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5658":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#单实例","content":"请通过进程管理工具（systemd、supervisor、Kubernetes）运行该二进制。目前尚未提供 start/stop 脚本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5659":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"除临时分片数据和凭据外，网关是无状态的，因此可以部署在负载均衡之后：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5660":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"当网关