erations/cli-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#hdfshdfs","content":"HDFS（`hdfs://`）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6229":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#webhdfswebhdfs","content":"WebHDFS（`webhdfs://`）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6230":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","content":"本节基于当前仓库源码中的 `curvine-cli`、`build/cv` 和 `build/bin/dfs` 整理 Curvine 的命令行入口。当前主要有三类：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6231":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","content":"**原生 Rust CLI `cv`**：推荐入口，功能最完整，命令树来自 `curvine-cli`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6232":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","content":"**兼容包装器 `dfs`**：发行包自带的兼容入口，`fs` / `report` 走 Java `CurvineShell`，保留 Hadoop `FsShell` 风格。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6233":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","content":"**POSIX / FUSE**：通过 FUSE 挂载后，直接在挂载点使用标准 Linux 命令。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6234":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"查看总览：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6235":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"当前源码对应的顶层命令为：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6236":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"所有 `cv` 命令都支持以下全局参数：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6237":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"| 全局参数            | 说明                                                     |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--conf <PATH>` | 仅覆盖本次调用的集群配置文件。未指定时 CLI 使用正常配置路径或 `CURVINE_CONF_FILE`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6238":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"| 全局参数                     | 说明                                            |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `--master-addrs <ADDRS>` | 直接覆盖客户端配置里的 Master 地址列表，例如 `m1:8995,m2:8995`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6239":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生产环境通常直接使用 `cv`，因为集群配置已安装，或已通过 `CURVINE_CONF_FILE` 选择。仅在迁移或诊断时使用 `--conf` 指向非默认配置。`cv mount --config key=value` 仍表示 UFS 配置项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6240":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"**约定：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"6241":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生