ntent":"Set `terminal_retention` according to how long completed jobs must remain queryable.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6771":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-121","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#92-capacity-and-retention","content":"Monitor the Transfer `/metrics` endpoint and the `cv transfer list` backlog.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6772":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-122","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                               | Symptom                     | Solution                                    |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Using `localhost` in distributed mode | Workers cannot reach Master | Set proper hostnames via env vars or config |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6773":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-123","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                                  | Symptom                    | Solution                                              |\n| ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Renaming large S3 directories in fs_mode | Operation blocks for hours | Avoid rename on object storage; copy + delete instead |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6774":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-124","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                         | Symptom                        | Solution                                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| TTL too short for training data | Cache thrashing, low hit ratio | Increase `--ttl-ms` to match training epoch duration |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6775":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-125","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall             | Symptom             | Solution                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| FUSE2 in production | 50% throughput loss | Upgrade to FUSE3 or use `mnt_number = 4` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6776":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-126","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                       | Symptom                               | Solution                                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `rclone` preserving old mtime | Files immediately expire after import | Adjust mtime after import or disable TTL temporarily |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6777":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-127","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                     | Symptom                        | Solution                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| Single Master in production | Cluster down on Master failure | Deploy 3-node Raft group |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6778":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-128","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                              | Symptom                   | Solution                           |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `format_master = true` in production | Metadata wiped on restart | Set to `false` after initial setup |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6779":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-129","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                        | Symptom                   | Solution                              |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Ignoring `failed_disks` metric | Data loss on disk failure | Monitor and replace disks proactively |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6780":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-130","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                         | Symptom                                   | Solution                            |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| Not running `resync` in fs_mode | Stale metadata after external UFS changes | Schedule periodic `cv mount resync` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6781":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-131","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                              | Symptom                                  | Solution                                |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Block size too small for large files | Excessive connections, slow random reads | Use `--block-size 1GB` for files > 10GB |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6782":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-132","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#11-security-recommendations","content":"Rotate UFS credentials regularly; use IAM roles where possible.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6783":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-133","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#11-security-recommendations","content":"Use network policies (K8s) or firewall rules to restrict access to Master RPC (8995) and Worker RPC (8997) ports.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6784":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-134","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#11-security-recommendations","content":"Enable audit logging (`audit_logging_enabled = true`) for compliance-sensitive environments.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6785":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-135","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#11-security-recommendations","content":"In multi-tenant environments, isolate namespaces by using separate Curvine paths per team with quota controls.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6786":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-136","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#12-upgrade-and-maintenance","content":"Always take a metadata snapshot before upgrading Master nodes.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6787":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-137","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#12-upgrade-and-maintenance","content":"Perform rolling upgrades: upgrade Followers first, then trigger leader transfer and upgrade the last node.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6788":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-138","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#12-upgrade-and-maintenance","content":"After upgrading Workers, verify heartbeat registration via the Web UI or `bin/cv report`.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6789":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-139","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#12-upgrade-and-maintenance","content":"Test FUSE remount after upgrades: `bin/curvine-fuse.sh restart`.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6790":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-140","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#12-upgrade-and-maintenance","content":"Keep `retain_checkpoint_num = 3` (default) to allow rollback to previous metadata states.","locale":"zh-cn"},"6791":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals","type":"page","content":"User Manuals","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals","locale":"zh-cn"},"6792":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","type":"page","content":"性能调优","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","locale":"zh-cn"},"6793":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-0","page_id":"/