ply write type and cache/consistency behavior. |"],[205,"| Component  | Responsibility                                                                      |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Worker** | Block storage (BlockStore/BlockDataset), block read/write RPC, heartbeat to Master. |"],[3336,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| FUSE      | `http://<host>:9003/metrics` | 9003 |"],[6756,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| FUSE      | `http://<host>:9003/metrics` | 9003 |"],[3334,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Master    | `http://<host>:9001/metrics` | 9001 |"],[6754,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Master    | `http://<host>:9001/metrics` | 9001 |"],[3335,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Worker    | `http://<host>:9002/metrics` | 9002 |"],[6755,"| Component | Endpoint                     | Port |\n| --------- | ---------------------------- | ---- |\n| Worker    | `http://<host>:9002/metrics` | 9002 |"],[1764,"| Component | Required change | Notes                                                                                                                      |\n| --------- | --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Master    | None.           | The Master does not need a configuration change; clients that disable Transfer keep using the legacy Load and Export RPCs. |"],[1765,"| Component | Required change | Notes                                                                                            |\n| --------- |